# p1-headless -- p1-reference with no window, driven from the monitor socket.
#
# Screenshots come from `screendump` over the monitor socket, so boot progress
# can be captured without anyone watching a screen. VNC is on :5 as a way in,
# but note that Vinagre (Mint's default viewer) grabs input with no obvious
# release -- prefer p1-interactive if you actually want to click things.

@include p1-reference

-display
none
-monitor
unix:%IMAGES%/work/monitor.sock,server,nowait
-vnc
:5
